---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /places/
title: All Places
seo:
  title: "All Places — Andean Road"
  description: "Every place worth going in Chile — restaurants, vineyards, hot springs, volcanoes and museums, grouped by region."
---

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-overline">The full list</div>
  <h1 class="hero-title">Places</h1>
  <p class="hero-lede">Every place on this site, grouped by region. {{ collections.places | length }} in total — each one somewhere I've actually been.</p>
</div>

<hr class="rule rule--heavy">

{% for slug, region in regions %}
  {% set placesHere = [] %}
  {% for item in collections.places %}
    {% if item.data.region == slug %}{% set placesHere = (placesHere.push(item), placesHere) %}{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}

  {% if placesHere | length %}
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-label">{{ region.description }}</div>
    <div class="section-title">
      <a href="/regions/{{ slug }}/" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none">{{ region.label }}</a>
    </div>

    {% for item in placesHere %}
      {% include "partials/place-entry.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<hr class="rule rule--section">

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-label">Another way in</div>
  <div class="section-title">Browse by trip style</div>
  <div class="section-description">Same places, sorted by the kind of trip you're planning.</div>

  <div class="practical-list">
    {% for slug, audience in audiences %}
    <a href="/for/{{ slug }}/" class="practical-link">{{ audience.label }}</a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
